BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Heist
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260905T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260905T213000
UID:bat-202609051930-heist@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. A band of criminals\, torn apart by suspicion and betrayal\
 , reunites for one last job. The target: a multi-million dollar ruby owned
  by an international jewel thief. When the plan goes sideways\, they slowl
 y realize that when stealing from a thief\, there are no rules.
LOCATION:Waldron Auditorium @ Waldron Arts Center
URL:https://seeconstellation.org/mainstage/heist/
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
