BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Cook-Off
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260918T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260918T213000
UID:bat-202609181930-the-cook-off@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. In this new opera\, chefs face off in a televised cooking c
 ontest preparing one of America’s favorite comfort foods: macaroni and c
 heese. But the ensuing tensions are far from comforting as the cutthroat c
 ompetition reveals deeper truths about food\, culture\, and history.
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater
URL:https://operaballet.indiana.edu/events/cook-off.html
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
