UID:bat-202610021900-an-evening-with-cliff-cash@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Cliff Cash is a nationally touring stand-up comedian known 
 for thoughtful\, road-tested comedy and a nomadic lifestyle spent performi
 ng across the U.S. His special The Long Road became a breakout hit in 2025
 \, topping the iTunes comedy chart and earning millions of views online.
