BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Tender Land
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261017T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261017T213000
UID:bat-202610171930-the-tender-land@bloomingtonarts.today
DESCRIPTION:$. Considered one of Copland’s finest scores\, this opera is
  set in the Depression-era Midwest and tells the story of an isolated girl
  on the eve of high-school graduation who must decide how to live her life
 . Inspired by James Agee and Walker Evans’ book Let Us Now Praise Famous
  Men.
LOCATION:IU Musical Arts Center
URL:https://operaballet.indiana.edu/events/tender-land.html
X-SOURCE:BloomingtonArts.Today
END:VEVENT
