UID:bat-202610221900-emil-wakim-films-his-netflix-special@bloomingtonarts.
 today
DESCRIPTION:$. Emil Wakim\, the first Lebanese American cast member on Sat
 urday Night Live\, returns to The Comedy Attic to film his debut Netflix s
 tand-up special — nearly a decade after starting his comedy career there
 . Wakim has also appeared on The Tonight Show\, Don’t Tell Comedy\, and 
 Comedy Central\, and was named a Just For Laughs New Face in 2022.
